The web page contains the project title, a comment text area, an Analyze Comment button, a loading indicator, and a result section. The result section displays prediction, confidence, toxicity score, severity, moderation action, and an explanation/reason where provided by the backend. The frontend calls the backend using a JSON request and presents errors if the request fails.
